            {
                "entry_id": "43ab54f0-3129-302a-aae4-e3aa2611bac0",
                "word": "deterrent",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e6b5f9b4-b614-4524-82e3-7b400e39811a",
                        "entry_id": "43ab54f0-3129-302a-aae4-e3aa2611bac0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "deterrents"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9f826b8-9f36-32b3-8288-f78364b67eeb",
                        "entry_id": "43ab54f0-3129-302a-aae4-e3aa2611bac0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something that deters."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "502dbfab-4268-474b-8ef7-6cc627be5d74",
                                "sense_id": "a9f826b8-9f36-32b3-8288-f78364b67eeb",
                                "text": "An extension of the system to serve new housing estates on the outskirts of the city, at an estimated cost of about £4,000,000 a mile, is being considered, but the narrow gauge, small clearances, and short platforms are deterrents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c497e8d4-fe72-4c04-b8d9-75fe07539a5c",
                                "sense_id": "a9f826b8-9f36-32b3-8288-f78364b67eeb",
                                "text": "The salarians believed the genophage would be used as a deterrent, a position the turians viewed as naive. Once the project was complete, the turians mass produced and deployed it. The krogan homeworld, their colonies, and all occupied worlds were infected."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a131688-0072-4632-b934-685fc76f205f",
                                "sense_id": "a9f826b8-9f36-32b3-8288-f78364b67eeb",
                                "text": "One argument made by proponents of the death penalty is that it is a strong deterrent to murder and other violent crimes, but evidence shows just the opposite. Whereas the last execution in Canada took place in 1962, in 2011 there were 598 murders in Canada and 14,610 in the United States."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "381d9ae6-edd5-429f-87ed-07478e247327",
                                "sense_id": "a9f826b8-9f36-32b3-8288-f78364b67eeb",
                                "text": "All is well until Treorchy, where the platform is swamped by teenagers who have been attending an event. Around four dozen unescorted 12 to 16 year-olds swarm aboard and begin to run riot through the train. Their behaviour is appalling and the presence of CCTV no deterrent."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cf0ae44b-c0e4-412c-9ab2-ce88dc5e72f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "43ab54f0-3129-302a-aae4-e3aa2611bac0",
                        "source_sense_id": "a9f826b8-9f36-32b3-8288-f78364b67eeb",
                        "source_sense_description": "something that deters",
                        "target_lang_word": "威慑物",
                        "target_lang_code": "zh",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "59af5be2-e92a-4577-87d1-3f17b958e579",
                        "source_entry_id": "43ab54f0-3129-302a-aae4-e3aa2611bac0",
                        "source_sense_id": "a9f826b8-9f36-32b3-8288-f78364b67eeb",
                        "source_sense_description": "something that deters",
                        "target_lang_word": "afschrikmiddel",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "afschrikmiddel",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e377db5-b484-37fa-851a-b2ac21250c9d",
                                        "entry_id": "a1b5a98c-24e5-3c8d-bc99-ea5e275e0374",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "iets wat mensen zo bang maakt zodat ze bepaalde (ongewenste) handelingen niet uitvoeren"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2296fd21-8a8b-430d-85eb-7c98637b03d7",
                                                "sense_id": "6e377db5-b484-37fa-851a-b2ac21250c9d",
                                                "text": "De jarenlange bezuinigingen hebben de Europese krijgsmachten zo uitgehold, dat atoomwapens voor de NAVO weer belangrijker worden als afschrikmiddel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49875e81-5cbe-4f3a-9832-13c92203331d",
                                                "sense_id": "6e377db5-b484-37fa-851a-b2ac21250c9d",
                                                "text": "In loop van de 20e eeuw ontwikkelde Piet zich van een tamelijk onintelligent hulpje dat spreekt in kromme zinnen meer en meer tot een volwaardige assistent van de verstrooide Sint. Ook werd Zwarte Piet met de jaren steeds minder gebruikt als afschrikmiddel voor stoute kinderen. De roe om te slaan en de zak om kinderen naar Spanje te verschepen verdwenen naar de achtergrond."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40bbd77f-7a9c-4f44-94bf-3e23a6685ef3",
                        "source_entry_id": "43ab54f0-3129-302a-aae4-e3aa2611bac0",
